    text:"Z.ai's GLM-5.3 went live on its Coding Plan subscription tiers ($18/$80/$168 a month), post-trained on the same 743B-parameter base as GLM-5.2 with no new pretraining run. Headline scores include Terminal-Bench 3.0 at 28.3% and CyberGym at 84.5%. Direct API per-token pricing hasn't been published yet; Z.ai says open weights follow roughly two weeks after launch, pending safety hardening.",
