    text:"The White House Office of Science and Technology Policy announced over $5 billion in federal commitments across 15+ agencies to embed AI into national scientific research through the Genesis Mission. The initiative selected 278 projects from over 5,000 applications, with the Energy Department alone announcing $293 million. The companion OSTP report frames the Genesis Mission around revitalizing the science enterprise, securing US dominance in critical technologies, ensuring science benefits all Americans, and launching a new golden age of science.",
