    source:{ name:"Linear", handle:"Linear", platform:"web", kind:"lab" },
    text:"Linear published its 'How Teams Build' data report showing that AI now authors almost half of all issues created in the tool, up from fewer than one in a thousand two years ago. At the current pace, AI will soon author more issues than people and integrations combined. Linear Agent now writes code using Claude Code and Codex, with agent-assisted editing flagged separately in version history for easy review and restoration.",
